.th CSTRIP I 12/4/78
.sh NAME
cstrip \*- strip extraneous garbage from C programs
.sh SYNOPSIS
.bd cstrip
.sh DESCRIPTION
.it Cstrip
removes comments, surplus line feeds, and unneccesary spaces from C programs.
Use as a filter.
.sh "SEE ALSO"
CC (I)
.sh DIAGNOSTICS
"Syntax error: n" \*- where
.it n
can be either: 1 (last char was '/');
2 or 3 (unended comment); 4 (unended string); 8 (last char was '\\').
.sh AUTHOR
Piers Lauder (\ University of Sydney\ )
.sh BUGS
The result is unreadable.
